cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, harness, or the released adapters, please cite the paper below."
title: "PLC Dual-Oracle: benchmark, harness, and verifier-grounded training for IEC 61131-3 Structured Text"
abstract: >-
  A 22-task IEC 61131-3 Structured Text benchmark with 71 formal safety properties
  and 48 execution scenarios, scored by a dual oracle (MATIEC compilation plus nuXmv
  model checking over a scan-indexed ST-to-SMV translation) and a scan-cycle
  scenario interpreter. Includes the evaluation harness, the verifier-grounded SFT
  and GRPO training code, the released LoRA adapters, and the raw results behind
  every number in the accompanying paper.
